  <p>We can now ask whether one structure is stationary, locally stable, lower than declared competitors, or thermodynamically preferred under a stated ensemble. The next question is more detailed: when a ground state is perturbed, how does its electronic density and force field respond, and how do those coupled derivatives become collective lattice vibrations?</p>

